          "from": "Proto-Finnic *meccä 'forest'",
          "to": "mets",
          "note": "Final *ä lost; Finnish metsä and Ingrian metsä keep it."
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Finnic *päivä 'day, sun'",
          "to": "päev",
          "note": "Final *ä lost (with *i > e in the diphthong); Finnish päivä keeps it."
        },
        {
